    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  What's going on...? ! Why... Why is Reunion doing this...?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "What's going on...? ! Why... Why is Reunion doing this...?"
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_130_doberm_ex\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  After all these years, the wolves in sheep's clothing finally bare their fangs.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "After all these years, the wolves in sheep's clothing finally bare their fangs."
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_016_medic\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"Medic\"]  The Infected... they, they're attacking the Ursus troops!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Medic",
        "content": "The Infected... they, they're attacking the Ursus troops!"
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_013_riop\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Guard\"]  But why?! Challenging the Ursus government like this is basically suicide!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "content": "But why?! Challenging the Ursus government like this is basically suicide!"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_130_doberm_ex\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  No, look at how fierce this attack is. This must have been a planned operation.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "No, look at how fierce this attack is. This must have been a planned operation."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  The place we rescued Doctor from was supposed to be top secret... but they somehow still managed to infiltrate it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "The place we rescued Doctor from was supposed to be top secret... but they somehow still managed to infiltrate it."
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  It's possible that Reunion's attack has already spread through Chernobog in its entirety.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "It's possible that Reunion's attack has already spread through Chernobog in its entirety."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_013_riop\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[name=\"Guard\"]  No... How, how can that be...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "content": "No... How, how can that be..."
