    },
    {
        "id": 108,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  It's just that... we don't have the luxury of sitting around waiting for Reunion to disband.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "It's just that... we don't have the luxury of sitting around waiting for Reunion to disband."
    },
    {
        "id": 109,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Additionally, nobody knows how long this situation will last...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Additionally, nobody knows how long this situation will last..."
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]  Therefore, the best course of action would be to take out the enemy and then get moving. Wouldn't you agree?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Therefore, the best course of action would be to take out the enemy and then get moving. Wouldn't you agree?"
    },
    {
